{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood-Pumping Combat, Thrilling Launch Action!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/fc66f140d118c19ac91172cda8907c34.poster.avif?t=1761215980\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/fc66f140d118c19ac91172cda8907c34.webm?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/fc66f140d118c19ac91172cda8907c34.mp4?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your beard and get ready for launch! In this unique roguelike tower-climbing game, you become a dwarf commander, firing your warriors like cannonballs! Every grab and launch is the ultimate test of your reflexes and precision. Smash through enemy lines and demolish fortified walls\u2014this isn\u2019t some delicate magic duel, it\u2019s pure physical annihilation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Legendary Arms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/1e7a66779014acd3f763a07e95aea2ec.poster.avif?t=1761215980\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/1e7a66779014acd3f763a07e95aea2ec.webm?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/1e7a66779014acd3f763a07e95aea2ec.mp4?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Sparks fly in our forges! With a rich equipment crafting system, you\u2019ll personally forge legendary weapons. From bloodthirsty battle-axes to rune-inscribed heavy armor, every piece of gear embodies generations of dwarf craftsmanship. Gather rare materials, create your own divine arms, and show those green-skinned monsters what true craftsmanship looks like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/f346ccd0c416f549dbc53900fbfa4a63.poster.avif?t=1761215980\" width=322 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/f346ccd0c416f549dbc53900fbfa4a63.webm?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/f346ccd0c416f549dbc53900fbfa4a63.mp4?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken Combat Talents</strong><br>Choose your path to war! An expansive talent tree covers dozens of specializations like Axe Mastery, Firearms Expert, and Engineering Genius. Prefer close-quarters combat? Max out Frenzied Slash! Lean toward long-range firepower? Unlock Explosive Barrage! Each weapon type features unique skill combos, allowing you to develop your own distinct combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild Your Fortress Home</strong><br>Rise from the ruins and rebuild your homeland! Manage your underground stronghold: build taverns to recruit more dwarf warriors, open mines to dig for rare gems, and set up engineering workshops to develop new equipment. Every structure is a crucial step toward reclaiming your homeland, and every mug of ale fuels your warriors\u2019 charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the Homeland\u2014Full Salvo!</strong><br>When those foolish monsters dare set foot on our land again, it\u2019s time to show them the wrath of the dwarves! Load the gunpowder, calibrate the trajectory, and blast these scum back to hell! For our mines, our glory, our kingdom\u2014full salvo, fire!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072200?t=1761215980","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072200?t=1761215980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/62b484e712e32b99ad1179a5f51f1a55c3de8c0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761215980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/62b484e712e32b99ad1179a5f51f1a55c3de8c0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761215980","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood-Pumping Combat, Thrilling Launch Action!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/fc66f140d118c19ac91172cda8907c34.poster.avif?t=1761215980\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/fc66f140d118c19ac91172cda8907c34.webm?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/fc66f140d118c19ac91172cda8907c34.mp4?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your beard and get ready for launch! In this unique roguelike tower-climbing game, you become a dwarf commander, firing your warriors like cannonballs! Every grab and launch is the ultimate test of your reflexes and precision. Smash through enemy lines and demolish fortified walls\u2014this isn\u2019t some delicate magic duel, it\u2019s pure physical annihilation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Legendary Arms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/1e7a66779014acd3f763a07e95aea2ec.poster.avif?t=1761215980\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/1e7a66779014acd3f763a07e95aea2ec.webm?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/1e7a66779014acd3f763a07e95aea2ec.mp4?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Sparks fly in our forges! With a rich equipment crafting system, you\u2019ll personally forge legendary weapons. From bloodthirsty battle-axes to rune-inscribed heavy armor, every piece of gear embodies generations of dwarf craftsmanship. Gather rare materials, create your own divine arms, and show those green-skinned monsters what true craftsmanship looks like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/f346ccd0c416f549dbc53900fbfa4a63.poster.avif?t=1761215980\" width=322 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/f346ccd0c416f549dbc53900fbfa4a63.webm?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/extras/f346ccd0c416f549dbc53900fbfa4a63.mp4?t=1761215980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken Combat Talents</strong><br>Choose your path to war! An expansive talent tree covers dozens of specializations like Axe Mastery, Firearms Expert, and Engineering Genius. Prefer close-quarters combat? Max out Frenzied Slash! Lean toward long-range firepower? Unlock Explosive Barrage! Each weapon type features unique skill combos, allowing you to develop your own distinct combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild Your Fortress Home</strong><br>Rise from the ruins and rebuild your homeland! Manage your underground stronghold: build taverns to recruit more dwarf warriors, open mines to dig for rare gems, and set up engineering workshops to develop new equipment. Every structure is a crucial step toward reclaiming your homeland, and every mug of ale fuels your warriors\u2019 charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the Homeland\u2014Full Salvo!</strong><br>When those foolish monsters dare set foot on our land again, it\u2019s time to show them the wrath of the dwarves! Load the gunpowder, calibrate the trajectory, and blast these scum back to hell! For our mines, our glory, our kingdom\u2014full salvo, fire!</p>","developers":["COCOLAUGH STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072200/429af4c81f3d9ce9b437db247632c4aff95942d9/header.jpg?t=1761215980","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4072200/2009953698/848cbccb3ecbff78de7abbb69529b81bb3575e0e/1759611388/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759616632","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4072200/2009953698/848cbccb3ecbff78de7abbb69529b81bb3575e0e/1759611388/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759616632","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4072200/2009953698/848cbccb3ecbff78de7abbb69529b81bb3575e0e/1759611388/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759616632","id":257212328,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212328/movie480.mp4?t=175961663